{"name": "盛·淮扬(长风大悦城店)", "name_en": null, "brand_group": "盛·淮扬", "brand_confirmed": false, "scene": "正餐", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "苏菜", "淮扬菜"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["河鲜", "肉禽", "蟹/海鲜"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["可预订"], "price_avg": 130, "price_range": "¥100-160", "price_sources": [{"platform": "携程美食", "value": 130, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/ctripyouyoustar2/122743233.html"}], "district": "普陀区", "address": "上海市普陀区长风大悦城(大渡河路196号)", "business_area": "长风公园/大渡河路", "lat": null, "lng": null, "coord_source": null, "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "大众点评/商场预订", "signature_dishes": ["石锅鳝丝", "蟹粉豆腐", "淮扬狮子头", "淮扬大煮干丝", "熟醉膏蟹", "竹筒咸肉菜饭"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "scores": {"objective": 72, "diner": 68, "taste": 70, "endorsement": 40, "soft_ad_penalty": 3, "platform_credibility": 0.85}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "招牌石锅鳝丝，蟹粉豆腐，淮扬狮子头，淮扬大煮干丝，桂花酒酿丸子，招牌全蟹粉馓子，熟醉膏蟹，招牌竹筒咸肉菜饭，镇江肴蹄，飘香毛血旺，宫爆鳝背，干煎带鱼，招牌油煎蔬菜包。", "dish": "石锅鳝丝/蟹粉豆腐/淮扬狮子头", "source": "携程美食", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/ctripyouyoustar2/122743233.html", "date": "2026-09-22"}, {"quote": "在外滩吃淮扬菜挖到王炸！这口功夫菜鲜到舔盘。大煮干丝，干丝切得细如发丝，和虾仁、鸡丝、香菇一起炖，汤汁鲜得掉眉毛。翡翠烧卖，薄如纸的皮裹着青菜馅，翠绿得像玉石。", "dish": "大煮干丝/翡翠烧卖", "source": "携程笔记", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=170233029", "date": "2025-07-12"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程美食", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/ctripyouyoustar2/122743233.html"}], "negative_signals": ["商场店，评价样本少", "菜单偏融合，淮扬正脉性待验"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["长风大悦城商场客流", "家庭聚餐场景"]}, "sources": [{"title": "盛·淮扬(长风大悦城店) - 携程美食", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/ctripyouyoustar2/122743233.html", "type": "platform"}, {"title": "外滩淮扬菜功夫菜", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=170233029", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-23", "notes": "发