{"name": "黄浦轩臻品·淮扬(上海大厦店)", "name_en": "Huangpuxuan", "brand_group": "上海大厦", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": "正餐", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "苏菜", "淮扬菜"], ["中餐", "苏菜", "苏菜Fine Dining"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["河鲜", "肉禽", "汤/煲"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["可预订", "包间"], "price_avg": 280, "price_range": "¥250-350", "price_sources": [{"platform": "携程美食", "value": 280, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/4998884-dianping.html"}], "district": "虹口区", "address": "上海市虹口区北苏州路20号上海大厦", "business_area": "北外滩/外白渡桥", "lat": null, "lng": null, "coord_source": null, "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "电话/酒店预订", "signature_dishes": ["大煮干丝", "清炖狮子头", "软兜黄鳝", "扬州炒饭", "文思豆腐", "白汁江团鱼"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "scores": {"objective": 78, "diner": 70, "taste": 80, "endorsement": 75, "soft_ad_penalty": 1, "platform_credibility": 0.9}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "黄浦轩臻品·淮扬(上海大厦店)，大煮干丝，清炖狮子头，黑胡椒牛肉粒，软兜黄鳝，扬州炒饭，炝虎尾，冰皮小笼包，水晶肴肉，香酥鸭，淮扬软兜夹饼，文思豆腐，白汁江团鱼，松茸炖雪融豆腐。", "dish": "大煮干丝/清炖狮子头/软兜黄鳝", "source": "携程美食", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/4998884-dianping.html", "date": "2026-09-22"}, {"quote": "地道淮扬功夫菜，带长辈来准没错。狮子头软糯入味，肥瘦比例刚好，筷子一夹就散，入口绵密化渣。大煮干丝细腻精致，干丝切得比火柴棍还细，吸饱了鸡汤的鲜，软嫩但不烂，配着火腿丝和虾仁。", "dish": "狮子头/大煮干丝", "source": "携程笔记", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=323841379", "date": "2026-06-19"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程美食", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/4998884-dianping.html"}], "negative_signals": ["老牌酒店餐厅，环境偏老派", "价格偏高，性价比一般"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["上海大厦历史建筑，外滩景观", "商务宴请/长辈局"]}, "sources": [{"title": "黄浦轩臻品·淮扬(上海大厦店) - 携程美食", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/4998884-dianping.html", "type": "platform"}, {"title": "地道淮扬功夫菜带长辈", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=323841379", "typ